# why: The plugin-toolset cache was persisted before plugin discovery finished; a toolset built with create_custom_toolset over a built-in tool (krew-hands' skill_read) carries no plugin-registered tool, so the CLI's unknown-toolset check raced discovery and reported it as a typo. The persist step also sweeps static TOOLSETS keys absent from get_plugin_toolsets().
